---
// darsay.io is one theme, gold on space; there is no light palette to switch
// to, so the document is always dark and the picker is not rendered
// (ThemeSelect.astro). `updatePickers` stays a function because Starlight's
// own components call it.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
